    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE JUNE, 1954 EFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 1954\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nBeginning June 18 ...\nDC-7\nMainliners\nfly NONSTOP...\nNEW YORK-LOS ANGELES",
      "To the ORIENT\nHONOLUL\nTo AUSTRALIA\nNEW ZEALAND\nthe ORIENT\nCall United first WHENEVER YOU PLAN TO TRAVEL OR SHIP\nTo ALASKA\nPACIFIC TIME\nMOUNTAIN TIME\nCENTRAL TIME\nEASTERR TIME\nTo the ORIENT\nMONTEREY\nCEDAR CITY\nLAS VEGAS\nBAKERSFIELD\nHOOVER\nKANSAS CITY\nSAINTTLOUIS\nLOUSVILLE\nCHITA\nSANTA BARBARA\nHAWAII\n*VANCOUVER\nCALGARY\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nCUT-BANK\n- PORT ARTHUS\nSKATES AN\nWALLA WALI\n• PENDLETON\nOKLAI FALLS\nLEWISTOWN\nTHALLES\nOTHERAY\nMONTREAL\nOTTAWA,\nBUTTE\nBILLINGS\nMILES CITY\nTALLS\nSUN VALEY\nWEST YELLOWSTONE\n• SHERIDAN\nRAPID CITY-\nMINNEAPOLIS\nSAINT PAUL\nROCHESTER\n(POCATELO\nMILWAUKEE\nCASPER\nKED BLUPE\nCHEYENNE-T\nSCOTTSBLUFF NORTH\nSIOUX FALLST\nDES MOINES\nLINCOLN 1\nCLEVELAND\nROCK SPRINGS\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nRENO\nSACRAMENTO\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESHE\nI VISALIA\n/ CEDAR RAPIDS\nSALL LAKE CITY\nGRAND ISLAND\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER.\nNDIANAPOLIS\nPAYTON\nCINCINNATI\nASPEN\nCOLORADO SPRINGSİ\nAUGUSTA\nPORTLAND,\nTO EUROPE\nALBANY,\nBOSTON\nSPRINGFIELD\nPRINCE-TO EUROPE\nL HARTFORD\n-ALLENTOWN-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\n* NEW YORK\nNEWARK\nPHILADELPHIA\n7 BALTIMORE\nTo BERMUDA\nWASHINGTON and AFRICA,\nKNOXVIL\nTULSA\nLOS ANGELES\nCATALINA\nSAN DIEGO\nLONG BEACH\nOKLAHOHA CITY\nALBUDULKU,\nMEMPHIS\nLITTLE ROCK\nBIRMINCHAN\nTUCSON\nFORT WORTH\nBIG SPRING\nSHREVEPOR1\nHOUSTON\nSAN ANTONIO\nNEW ORLEANS\nTo LATIN AMERICA\nKEY\nUNITED AIR LINES\nBROWNSVILLE\nOTHER AIR LINES\nAll United Mainliners are fimed to the\nstars by the Elgin National\nWatch\nObservatory.\nOn your next business trip\nHAVE ALL DAY THERE..•\nWEST\nTo the WEST INDIES\nand SOUTH AMERICA\nTYPICAL MAINLINER ELAPSED TIMES (hours and minutes)\nTO→\nFROM\nBoston\nChicago\n4:30\nCleveland\nDenver\nDetroit\nHonolulu\nLos Angeles\nNew York\nOmaha\nPhiladelphia\nPortland\nSalt Lake City\nSan Francisco\nSeattle-Tacoma\nWashington, D.C.\nFly OVER AND BACK THE SAME DAY on\nUNITED MAINLINERS\nBoston.\nChicago.\nCleveland\nDenver.\nDetroit.\nHonolulu\nLos Angeles.\nNew York.\nOmaha..\nPhiladelphia.\nPortland\nSalt Lake City\nSan Francisco\nSeattle-Tacoma.\nWashington, D.C.\n2:35\n1:25\n3:50\n2:20\n7:50\n1:30\n8:55\n3:45\n5:55\n3:25\n5:30\n1:10\n5:35\n23:55 17:30|19:55 15:45\n18:40\n10:50\n6:30\n8:55\n3:25\n8:10 10:15\n3:15\n2:00\n5:30\n3:15 22:45\n7:55\n6:40\n1:45\n3:50\n2:10\n3:40 19:15\n6:30\n5:10\n3:00\n2:05\n7:30\n2:15 23:35 11:45\n0:35\n12:35\n10:20\n11:40\n13:00\n7:55 10:05\n4:00\n9:45|15:15\n3:35 10:15\n4:40\n7:05\n2:00\n6:30 16:45\n8:05\n6:45\n8:55\n4:00\n8:25\n9:30\n1:40\n7:35\n8:05 10:10\n4:10|10:00|15:00\n3:55 11:30\n2:40\n6:15\n..|22:55|10:25|\n26:45 12:10\n7:35\n3:50|11:20 13:00 13:55\n•••••\n1:05|19:00\n7:10\n2:55\n2:00\n2:40\n8:35\n5:30\n7:40\n8:45\n2:30\n22:00\n9:05\n1:50\n4:35\n1:50:10:45\n8:10|10:05\n12:05\n5:1515:30\n3:45\n5:50\n2:00\n7:30\n4:20\n2:10\n3:30\n4:30\n5:20\n20:50\n9:00|\n2:55\n3:55\n2:00:10:10\n8:15\n9:25\n11:30\n10:00/20:25|19:50\n21:10 13:00\n13:15\n9:15/14:20|20:00\n7:15\n5:55 10:40\n3:30\n1:35\n3:50\n9:30\n5:55\n0:35 12:30\n9:25\n9:30 12:55\n5:00\n7:20\n5:40\n7:15\n8:40\n5:45\n6:20\n12:35 10:05 12:10|13:55\n6:5512:15\n3:40\n2:25\n0:50\n9:55\n4:451\n9:00\n3•15\n3:20\n4:30\n7:45\n8:25.10:00\n2:20\n2:55\n2:50\n9:45\n8:1512:55\n0:50\n4:50\n2:55\n11:15\n5:25\n11:00|10:00|10:55|12:20"
